  "Used explicit pulse-counted thread slots (thread_t1, thread_t2, thread_ended, thread_snapped) instead of each_for or decay_per_pulse so natural 5 s expiration ties Knots and leaps Burn while heavy/slow snaps recoil without negative qi.",
  "Scoped When the Thread Breaks Knot bonuses on art_fired (Wood thread arts +1 Wood, burning-thread +2 Fire) because stack_grant lacks tags/art_id context, and gated 4% qi recoil on own.qi_share >= 0.04 per_pulse: 1.",
  "Gave burning-thread an empower on thread_t1/thread_t2 instead of a hard guard so standalone fire-in-the-thread suites fire cleanly, and gave fire-silk-weave a combat Fire ward (+60 Fire resist 5 s, 5% HP ward_grow, 1 Fire buff) alongside its seasonal craft lore.",
  "Marked Chars in a Season (chc-first-weave-robe) not_run as an out-of-fight seasonal reweaving/decay rule.",
  "Authored 3 chuc_ha non-lineage techniques (indigo-vat-canon, vat-stirring-breath, mulberry-row-breath) for the 3 stand-ins (nhiem_thanh_lam, mac_lam_y, nguu_thai_diep) with R6 exceptions and unique: true on all 3 items."
 ],
